#
# **What an operation added to its base class, asked of the loaded class rather than of its
# source.** This is the exact answer, and the cops are the fast approximation of it.
#
# `Shipshape/OneOperationOneClass` and `Shipshape/MixinsAddNothingPublic` read source. They
# run in a second, in an editor, without booting anything — and they cannot see a module
# included dynamically, a method made by `define_method`, or anything `class_eval` wrote.
# Nothing read from source can. So the same rule is asked again here, of the real class.
#
# **It works because the base classes are ours.** They are POROs in this repository with a
